/-- **Homotopy identity for a cylinder operator** (Simon Ch. 6, 2.17–2.22, and the homotopy
formula 2.25–2.27).  Let `cyl` take `X ∈ 𝒟ₖ(ℝᴺ)` to `cyl X ∈ 𝒟ₖ₊₁(ℝᴺ⁺¹)` with the slice property
